msgid ""
"Every feed in your account is checked at minimum every 15 minutes, with most feeds checked every 5 minutes."
" This is independent of how often the feed actually publishes."
msgstr ""
"Setiap feed di akun Anda diperiksa setidaknya setiap 15 menit, dan sebagian besar feed diperiksa setiap 5 "
"menit. Ini tidak bergantung pada seberapa sering feed tersebut menerbitkan konten."

msgid "Every layout, every theme, every keyboard shortcut. Train your feeds to surface what matters."
msgstr "Setiap tata letak, setiap tema, setiap pintasan keyboard. Latih feed Anda agar menampilkan hal yang penting."

msgid ""
"Every new account gets a free 30-day premium trial. No credit card required. When it ends, you keep your "
"feeds and training on the free tier."
msgstr ""
"Setiap akun baru mendapat uji coba Premium gratis selama 30 hari. Tidak perlu kartu kredit. Setelah masa "
