msgid ""
"If you used Google Reader, you'll feel at home in NewsBlur. Folder-based organization, keyboard shortcuts "
"for navigating and managing stories, a clean reading interface, and full OPML import and export are all "
"here. NewsBlur preserved the core reading experience that made Google Reader great."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda pernah menggunakan Google Reader, Anda akan merasa nyaman menggunakan NewsBlur. Pengelompokan "
"berdasarkan folder, pintasan keyboard untuk menavigasi dan mengelola artikel, antarmuka baca yang bersih, "
"serta impor dan ekspor OPML lengkap tersedia di sini. NewsBlur mempertahankan pengalaman membaca inti yang "
"menjadikan Google Reader hebat."

msgid ""
"If you've been searching for a Google Reader replacement, you've found it. NewsBlur isn't just an "
"alternative. It's the reader that Google Reader users chose, and the one that's still here."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda mencari pengganti Google Reader, Anda menemukannya. NewsBlur bukan sekadar alternatif. Inilah "
"pembaca berita pilihan para pengguna Google Reader, dan yang masih bertahan hingga kini."

msgid ""
"If your project or application allows users to interact with data from NewsBlur, you must cite NewsBlur as "
"the source of your data."
msgstr ""
"Jika proyek atau aplikasi Anda memungkinkan pengguna berinteraksi dengan data dari NewsBlur, Anda harus "
"mencantumkan NewsBlur sebagai sumber data Anda."

