"pengalaman membaca dengan berbagai pilihan font, lima ukuran teks, jarak baris yang dapat diatur, tampilan "
"ringkas atau lega, serta gaya pratinjau gambar. Setiap pengaturan dapat berbeda untuk tiap feed, sehingga "
"setiap situs tampil sesuai keinginan Anda."

msgid "Make your blurblog private so only you can see your shared stories. Control who sees what you're reading."
msgstr ""
"Jadikan blurblog Anda privat agar hanya Anda yang bisa melihat artikel yang dibagikan. Atur siapa yang bisa"
" melihat apa yang Anda baca."

msgid "Maker"
msgstr "Pembuat"

msgid "Manage NewsBlur"
msgstr "Kelola NewsBlur"

msgid "Manage feeds and folders"
msgstr "Kelola feed dan folder"

msgid "Manage feeds and stories from your terminal"
msgstr "Kelola feed dan artikel dari terminal"

msgid ""
"Manage your NewsBlur from the terminal. Read feeds, search stories, manage subscriptions, and train "
"classifiers. Pipe to jq, script your workflows, and automate with <code>--json</code> output. Works with "
"self-hosted instances too."
msgstr ""
"Kelola NewsBlur Anda dari terminal. Baca feed, cari artikel, kelola langganan, dan latih pengklasifikasi. "
"Gunakan jq, buat skrip alur kerja, dan otomatisasikan dengan keluaran <code>--json</code>. Juga berfungsi "
"dengan instans yang di-host sendiri."

msgid "Manual config required"
msgstr "Perlu konfigurasi manual"

msgid ""
"Many RSS feeds only include a summary or the first paragraph. Text view extracts the full story from the "
"original website and displays it right in NewsBlur, with clean formatting and no clutter. Read full "
"articles without leaving your reader."
msgstr ""
"Banyak feed RSS hanya menyertakan ringkasan atau paragraf pertama. Tampilan teks mengambil artikel lengkap "
"dari situs aslinya dan menampilkannya langsung di NewsBlur dengan pemformatan rapi tanpa gangguan. Baca "
"artikel lengkap tanpa meninggalkan pembaca Anda."

msgid "Mark all as read"
msgstr "Tandai semua sebagai telah dibaca"

msgid "Mark read by hash, feed, or folder"
msgstr "Tandai sudah dibaca berdasarkan hash, feed, atau folder"

msgid ""
"Mark stories as read, save stories with tags and notes, subscribe to new feeds, share stories to your "
"blurblog"
msgstr ""
"Tandai artikel sebagai telah dibaca, simpan artikel dengan tag dan catatan, berlangganan feed baru, bagikan"
" artikel ke blurblog Anda"

msgid "Migrating is easy with OPML import"
msgstr "Migrasi mudah dengan impor OPML"

msgid "Minimal (Go binary: 128 MB)"
msgstr "Minimal (biner Go: 128 MB)"

msgid "Missing XPath expressions for story extraction"
msgstr "Ekspresi XPath untuk ekstraksi artikel tidak ditemukan"

msgid "Missing `story_hash` list parameter."
msgstr "Parameter daftar `story_hash` tidak ada."

msgid "Missing apns_token."
msgstr "apns_token tidak ditemukan."

msgid "Missing feed_id"
msgstr "feed_id tidak ditemukan"

msgid "Missing feed_id or feed_title"
msgstr "feed_id atau feed_title tidak tersedia"

msgid "Missing feed_ids."
msgstr "feed_ids tidak ditemukan."

msgid "Missing or invalid feed id."
msgstr "ID feed tidak ada atau tidak valid."

msgid "Missing parameter: photo"
msgstr "Parameter tidak ada: foto"

msgid "Missing popular feed id or feed url"
msgstr "ID feed populer atau URL feed tidak ditemukan"

msgid "Missing prompt"
msgstr "Prompt tidak ditemukan"

msgid "Missing prompt or prompt_id"
msgstr "Prompt atau prompt_id tidak ada"

msgid "Missing story_hash"
msgstr "story_hash tidak ada"

msgid "Missing story_hash."
msgstr "story_hash tidak ada."

msgid "Missing username."
msgstr "Nama pengguna belum diisi."

msgid "Mobile Apps (Native)"
msgstr "Aplikasi Seluler (Native)"

msgid "Moderate"
msgstr "Moderasi"

msgid "Moderate (PHP + PostgreSQL: 512 MB)"
msgstr "Sedang (PHP + PostgreSQL: 512 MB)"

msgid "Moderation Queue"
msgstr "Antrean Moderasi"

msgid "More Features"
msgstr "Fitur Lainnya"

msgid "More affordable for serious readers"
msgstr "Lebih terjangkau bagi pembaca serius"

msgid "More ways to get help"
msgstr "Cara lain untuk mendapatkan bantuan"

msgid ""
"Most open source readers give you a reverse-chronological list of stories and leave it at that. NewsBlur "
"goes further with its intelligence training system. You can train on authors, tags, title keywords, full "
"text, URLs, and regex patterns to highlight stories you care about and hide the rest. Stories are color-"
"coded green, red, or neutral so you can see your training at work. On top of that, Ask AI lets you query "
"any story with Claude, GPT, Gemini, or Grok to get summaries, extract key points, or ask follow-up "
"questions."
msgstr ""
"Kebanyakan pembaca sumber terbuka menampilkan daftar artikel dalam urutan kronologis terbalik, lalu "
"berhenti sampai di situ. NewsBlur melangkah lebih jauh dengan sistem pelatihan kecerdasannya. Anda dapat "
"melatihnya berdasarkan penulis, tag, kata kunci judul, teks lengkap, URL, dan pola regex untuk menyoroti "
"artikel yang Anda pedulikan dan menyembunyikan sisanya. Artikel diberi kode warna hijau, merah, atau netral"
" agar Anda dapat melihat hasil pelatihan. Selain itu, Tanya AI memungkinkan Anda bertanya tentang artikel "
"apa pun menggunakan Claude, GPT, Gemini, atau Grok untuk mendapatkan ringkasan, mengekstrak poin penting, "
"atau mengajukan pertanyaan lanjutan."

msgid "Move and rename feeds"
msgstr "Pindahkan dan ganti nama feed"

msgid "Moving between the feed list, story list, and story detail is now much faster"
msgstr "Kini, berpindah antara daftar feed, daftar artikel, dan detail artikel jauh lebih cepat"

msgid "Multiple Layouts"
msgstr "Beragam Tata Letak"

msgid "Mute Sites"
msgstr "Bisukan Situs"

msgid "Muted!"
msgstr "Dibisukan!"

msgid "Native"
msgstr "Native"

msgid "Native Apps"
msgstr "Aplikasi Native"

msgid "Native Apps - NewsBlur"
msgstr "Aplikasi Native - NewsBlur"

msgid "Native Mobile Apps"
msgstr "Aplikasi Seluler Native"

msgid "Native apps and third-party support"
msgstr "Aplikasi native dan dukungan pihak ketiga"

msgid "Native apps on every platform"
msgstr "Aplikasi native di setiap platform"

msgid "Native apps vs. third-party ecosystem"
msgstr "Aplikasi native vs. ekosistem pihak ketiga"

msgid "Native apps, newsletters, and web feeds"
msgstr "Aplikasi native, buletin email, dan feed web"

msgid "Native controls for sending a story to other services (mail, safari, chrome, evernote, instapaper, etc)."
msgstr "Kontrol bawaan untuk mengirim artikel ke layanan lain (mail, Safari, Chrome, Evernote, Instapaper, dll.)."

msgid "Native iOS & Android Apps"
msgstr "Aplikasi iOS & Android Native"

msgid "Native on Android"
msgstr "Aplikasi native di Android"

msgid "Natural language text and image classifiers"
msgstr "Pengklasifikasi teks bahasa alami dan gambar"

msgid "Navigate everything without touching the mouse"
msgstr "Navigasikan semuanya tanpa menyentuh mouse"

msgid ""
"Navigate everything without touching the mouse. Open feeds, scroll through stories, mark as read, save, "
"share, train, switch views &mdash; all from the keyboard. Press <code>?</code> to see the full list. Power "
"readers can fly through hundreds of stories in minutes."
msgstr ""
"Navigasikan semuanya tanpa menyentuh mouse. Buka feed, gulir artikel, tandai telah dibaca, simpan, bagikan,"
" latih, ganti tampilan &mdash; semuanya dari keyboard. Tekan <code>?</code> untuk melihat daftar lengkap. "
"Pembaca andal dapat menelusuri ratusan artikel dalam hitungan menit."

msgid "Navigate your archive with date filters. Find stories from any time period."
msgstr "Jelajahi arsip Anda dengan filter tanggal. Temukan artikel dari periode waktu mana pun."

msgid ""
"Never miss a post from sites that publish rarely. The Infrequent Site Stories view collects stories from "
"feeds that only post once a week or less, making sure those gems don't get buried under high-volume feeds. "
"It's like a curated digest of your quietest subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"Jangan pernah melewatkan kiriman dari situs yang jarang menerbitkan konten. Tampilan Artikel dari Situs "
"yang Jarang Diperbarui mengumpulkan artikel dari feed yang hanya menerbitkan sekali seminggu atau lebih "
"jarang, sehingga konten istimewa itu tidak terkubur di antara feed yang sangat aktif. Ini seperti rangkuman"
" pilihan dari langganan Anda yang paling jarang diperbarui."

msgid "New Application"
msgstr "Aplikasi Baru"

msgid "New Features"
msgstr "Fitur Baru"

msgid "New Password"
msgstr "Kata Sandi Baru"

msgid ""
"New Safari-based browser for the original story. These views are faster and support content blockers on iOS"
" 9 and use your browser's cookies. However, they look like Safari and not NewsBlur, so the default in-app "
"browser is the original browser. The new in-app Safari browser is a preference, along with Chrome, Opera, "
"and the full Safari app."
msgstr ""
"Peramban baru berbasis Safari untuk artikel asli. Tampilan ini lebih cepat, mendukung pemblokir konten di "
"iOS 9, dan menggunakan cookie peramban Anda. Namun, tampilannya seperti Safari, bukan NewsBlur, jadi "
"peramban bawaan dalam aplikasi tetap peramban asli. Peramban Safari baru dalam aplikasi ini adalah pilihan "
"preferensi, bersama Chrome, Opera, dan aplikasi Safari lengkap."

msgid ""
"New accounts start with a <strong>30 day trial premium subscription</strong> &mdash; no credit card "
"required."
msgstr "Akun baru mendapatkan <strong>langganan premium uji coba 30 hari</strong> &mdash; tanpa perlu kartu kredit."

msgid "New content appears in your feed just like regular RSS"
msgstr "Konten baru muncul di feed Anda seperti RSS biasa"

msgid "New password"
msgstr "Kata sandi baru"

msgid "New preference for hiding feeds after they are read"
msgstr "Preferensi baru untuk menyembunyikan feed setelah dibaca"

msgid "New subscriptions automatically import the feed's full history so you have everything from day one."
msgstr "Langganan baru otomatis mengimpor seluruh riwayat feed sehingga semuanya tersedia sejak hari pertama."

msgid "New tag name is required."
msgstr "Nama tag baru wajib diisi."

msgid "NewsBlur - Connecting..."
msgstr "NewsBlur - Menghubungkan..."

msgid "NewsBlur Dashboard"
msgstr "Dasbor NewsBlur"

msgid "NewsBlur Features - Intelligence Training, AI, Search & More"
msgstr "Fitur NewsBlur - Pelatihan Kecerdasan, AI, Pencarian & Lainnya"

msgid "NewsBlur GitHub repository"
msgstr "Repositori GitHub NewsBlur"

msgid "NewsBlur News Popularity Spreadsheet Creator"
msgstr "Pembuat Spreadsheet Popularitas Berita NewsBlur"

msgid "NewsBlur Premium Subscription"
msgstr "Langganan NewsBlur Premium"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur Premium costs $36/year for up to 1,024 sites. Feedly Pro starts at $72/year. For that lower price,"
" NewsBlur includes full-text search, river of news, saved story tags, privacy options, text view, and all "
"the intelligence training features. The Archive plan at $99/year adds permanent story archiving, Ask AI "
"with Claude/GPT/Gemini/Grok, daily AI briefings, web feeds, and date-range filtering."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur Premium berharga $36/tahun untuk hingga 1.024 situs. Feedly Pro mulai dari $72/tahun. Dengan harga"
" yang lebih rendah, NewsBlur menyertakan pencarian teks lengkap, aliran berita, tag artikel tersimpan, opsi"
" privasi, tampilan teks, dan semua fitur pelatihan kecerdasan. Paket Archive seharga $99/tahun menambahkan "
"pengarsipan artikel permanen, Tanya AI dengan Claude/GPT/Gemini/Grok, ringkasan AI harian, feed web, dan "
"pemfilteran rentang tanggal."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur Premium starts at $36/year for up to 1,024 sites &mdash; half the cost of Feedly Pro. For power "
"users, NewsBlur Pro at $29/month includes 5-minute feed fetching for all 10,000 sites, regex classifiers, "
"and priority support. Feedly's comparable Enterprise plan costs $18/month but caps at 2,500 sources and "
"doesn't offer regex filtering or self-hosting."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur Premium mulai dari $36/tahun untuk hingga 1.024 situs &mdash; setengah harga Feedly Pro. Untuk "
"pengguna berat, NewsBlur Pro seharga $29/bulan mencakup pengambilan feed setiap 5 menit untuk semua 10.000 "
"situs, pengklasifikasi regex, dan dukungan prioritas. Paket Enterprise Feedly yang sebanding berharga "
"$18/bulan, tetapi dibatasi hingga 2.500 sumber dan tidak menyediakan pemfilteran regex atau hosting "
"mandiri."

msgid "NewsBlur Pricing - Plans for Every Reader"
msgstr "Harga NewsBlur - Paket untuk Setiap Pembaca"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur and Feedbin are both independent, privacy-respecting RSS readers built by small teams. They share "
"a commitment to open source and a belief that RSS should be simple and user-controlled. The key difference "
"is depth: Feedbin focuses on a clean, minimal reading experience. NewsBlur adds intelligence training, AI "
"features, social sharing, and native mobile apps on top of a similarly clean interface. If you want the "
"simplest possible reader, Feedbin is excellent. If you want more power without sacrificing usability, "
"NewsBlur delivers."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur dan Feedbin adalah pembaca RSS independen yang menghormati privasi dan dibuat oleh tim kecil. "
"Keduanya berkomitmen pada sumber terbuka dan percaya bahwa RSS seharusnya sederhana dan dikendalikan "
"pengguna. Perbedaan utamanya terletak pada kelengkapan: Feedbin berfokus pada pengalaman membaca yang "
"bersih dan minimalis. NewsBlur menambahkan pelatihan kecerdasan, fitur AI, berbagi sosial, dan aplikasi "
"seluler native di atas antarmuka yang sama bersihnya. Jika Anda menginginkan pembaca sesederhana mungkin, "
"Feedbin sangat bagus. Jika Anda menginginkan lebih banyak kemampuan tanpa mengorbankan kemudahan "
"penggunaan, NewsBlur adalah pilihannya."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur builds and maintains its own native iOS and Android apps with full feature parity, including "
"intelligence training, blurblog sharing, and text view. Feedbin relies entirely on third-party apps like "
"Reeder and NetNewsWire. Both approaches work, but NewsBlur's native apps mean every feature is available on"
" mobile from day one, without waiting for a third-party developer to add support."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur mengembangkan dan memelihara aplikasi native iOS dan Android sendiri dengan fitur yang setara "
"sepenuhnya, termasuk pelatihan kecerdasan, berbagi blurblog, dan tampilan teks. Feedbin sepenuhnya "
"mengandalkan aplikasi pihak ketiga seperti Reeder dan NetNewsWire. Kedua pendekatan ini sama-sama "
"berfungsi, tetapi aplikasi native NewsBlur menyediakan semua fitur di perangkat seluler sejak hari pertama,"
" tanpa perlu menunggu pengembang pihak ketiga menambahkan dukungan."

msgid "NewsBlur can't find that page"
msgstr "NewsBlur tidak dapat menemukan halaman itu"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur continues to evolve with AI-powered features, daily briefings, and intelligence training that gets"
" smarter over time. Still independent, still open source, still built for readers who care about the news."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur terus berkembang dengan fitur berbasis AI, ringkasan harian, dan pelatihan kecerdasan yang makin "
"pintar seiring waktu. Tetap independen, tetap sumber terbuka, dan tetap dibuat untuk pembaca yang peduli "
"pada berita."

msgid "NewsBlur experienced an error"
msgstr "NewsBlur mengalami kesalahan"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur gives you intelligence training to control your reading, AI-powered summaries, native mobile apps,"
" and full open source transparency. Switching takes less than a minute."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur memberi Anda pelatihan kecerdasan untuk mengendalikan bacaan, ringkasan bertenaga AI, aplikasi "
"seluler native, dan transparansi sumber terbuka sepenuhnya. Beralih hanya membutuhkan waktu kurang dari "
"satu menit."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur gives you more control over your reading, costs less, and is fully open source. Switching takes "
"less than a minute."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur memberi Anda kendali lebih besar atas bacaan, biayanya lebih rendah, dan sepenuhnya sumber "
"terbuka. Beralih hanya membutuhkan waktu kurang dari satu menit."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur gives you personal training instead of rules, built-in AI features, story clustering, and a fully "
"open source codebase you can self-host."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur menyediakan pelatihan personal alih-alih aturan, fitur AI bawaan, pengelompokan artikel, dan basis"
" kode sumber terbuka penuh yang dapat Anda host sendiri."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur has been running continuously since 2009. That's over fifteen years of uptime, development, and "
"community trust. It survived the Google Reader shutdown, the rise and fall of social media as a news "
"source, and the ongoing consolidation of the web. Through all of it, NewsBlur has stayed independent, open "
"source, and focused on one thing: giving you the best way to read the news."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur telah beroperasi tanpa henti sejak 2009. Itu berarti lebih dari lima belas tahun beroperasi, "
"dikembangkan, dan dipercaya komunitas. Layanan ini bertahan melewati penutupan Google Reader, naik turunnya"
" media sosial sebagai sumber berita, dan konsolidasi web yang terus berlangsung. Selama itu semua, NewsBlur"
" tetap independen, bersumber terbuka, dan berfokus pada satu hal: memberi Anda cara terbaik untuk membaca "
"berita."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur has native iOS and Android apps built and maintained alongside the web app. Every feature, "
"including intelligence training, blurblog sharing, text view, and dark mode, works on mobile. NewsBlur also"
" works with third-party apps like Reeder, ReadKit, Unread, and NetNewsWire. You get the best of both "
"worlds: first-party apps with full features and third-party app compatibility through a standard API."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur memiliki aplikasi iOS dan Android native yang dikembangkan dan dipelihara bersama aplikasi web. "
"Semua fitur, termasuk pelatihan kecerdasan, berbagi blurblog, tampilan teks, dan mode gelap, tersedia di "
"perangkat seluler. NewsBlur juga berfungsi dengan aplikasi pihak ketiga seperti Reeder, ReadKit, Unread, "
"dan NetNewsWire. Anda mendapatkan yang terbaik dari kedua dunia: aplikasi resmi dengan fitur lengkap dan "
"kompatibilitas aplikasi pihak ketiga melalui API standar."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur has native iOS and Android apps, plus full sync with popular third-party readers like Reeder, "
"ReadKit, Unread, and NetNewsWire. The Old Reader is primarily a web application with limited third-party "
"integration. For mobile reading, NewsBlur provides a significantly better experience with native apps built"
" specifically for each platform."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur memiliki aplikasi native untuk iOS dan Android, serta sinkronisasi penuh dengan pembaca pihak "
"ketiga populer seperti Reeder, ReadKit, Unread, dan NetNewsWire. The Old Reader terutama merupakan aplikasi"
" web dengan integrasi pihak ketiga yang terbatas. Untuk membaca di perangkat seluler, NewsBlur memberikan "
"pengalaman yang jauh lebih baik dengan aplikasi native yang dibuat khusus untuk tiap platform."

msgid "NewsBlur iOS app on iPad showing the dashboard"
msgstr "Aplikasi NewsBlur iOS di iPad yang menampilkan dasbor"

msgid "NewsBlur in dark mode showing the full interface"
msgstr "NewsBlur dalam mode gelap dengan seluruh antarmuka ditampilkan"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur includes native iOS and Android apps built in-house. The other open source readers rely on third-"
"party clients via API compatibility layers. NewsBlur also lets you forward email newsletters into your feed"
" reader and follow websites that don't have RSS at all using web feeds. These features are built into the "
"hosted service and the self-hosted version alike."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur menyediakan aplikasi iOS dan Android native yang dikembangkan sendiri. Pembaca sumber terbuka "
"lainnya mengandalkan klien pihak ketiga melalui lapisan kompatibilitas API. NewsBlur juga memungkinkan Anda"
" meneruskan buletin email ke pembaca feed dan mengikuti situs web yang tidak memiliki RSS menggunakan feed "
"web. Fitur-fitur ini tersedia baik di layanan yang dihosting maupun versi yang dihosting sendiri."

msgid "NewsBlur is a news reader and aggregator developed by Samuel Clay at NewsBlur, Inc."
msgstr "NewsBlur adalah pembaca dan agregator berita yang dikembangkan oleh Samuel Clay di NewsBlur, Inc."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur is free on the web, iPad, iPhone, and Android. By subscribing to a premium account, you support a "
"growing service and unlock a few restrictions."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur gratis di web, iPad, iPhone, dan Android. Dengan berlangganan akun premium, Anda mendukung layanan"
" yang terus berkembang dan membuka beberapa batasan."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur is fully open source under the MIT license. The entire codebase, including the web app, iOS app, "
"Android app, and all backend services, is available on GitHub. You can inspect it, contribute to it, or run"
" your own self-hosted instance with Docker. Even if NewsBlur the service were to stop operating, the "
"software would live on. Your reading workflow is never at the mercy of a single company's quarterly "
"earnings call."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur sepenuhnya bersumber terbuka di bawah lisensi MIT. Seluruh basis kodenya, termasuk aplikasi web, "
"aplikasi iOS, aplikasi Android, dan semua layanan backend, tersedia di GitHub. Anda dapat memeriksanya, "
"berkontribusi, atau menjalankan instans mandiri Anda sendiri dengan Docker. Bahkan jika layanan NewsBlur "
"berhenti beroperasi, perangkat lunaknya akan tetap ada. Alur membaca Anda tidak pernah bergantung pada "
"rapat laporan pendapatan triwulanan satu perusahaan."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur is fully open source under the MIT license. The entire codebase, including web, iOS, Android, and "
"all backend services, is on <a href=\"https://github.com/samuelclay/NewsBlur\">GitHub</a>. You can self-"
"host your own instance with Docker, contribute features, or simply audit the code. If you ever want to "
"leave, OPML export takes your feeds anywhere. Your reading data is never held hostage."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur sepenuhnya bersumber terbuka di bawah lisensi MIT. Seluruh basis kode, termasuk web, iOS, Android,"
" dan semua layanan backend, tersedia di <a href=\"https://github.com/samuelclay/NewsBlur\">GitHub</a>. Anda"
" dapat menghosting sendiri dengan Docker, berkontribusi menambahkan fitur, atau sekadar mengaudit kodenya. "
"Jika suatu saat ingin berhenti, ekspor OPML memungkinkan Anda membawa feed ke mana saja. Data bacaan Anda "
"tidak pernah disandera."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur is fully open source under the MIT license. The entire codebase, web, iOS, Android, and all "
"backend services, is on <a href=\"https://github.com/samuelclay/NewsBlur\">GitHub</a>. You can self-host "
"your own instance with Docker, contribute features, or audit the code. Inoreader is proprietary and closed-"
"source. If you ever want to leave NewsBlur, OPML export takes your feeds anywhere. Your reading data is "
"never held hostage."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur sepenuhnya bersumber terbuka di bawah lisensi MIT. Seluruh basis kode—web, iOS, Android, dan semua"
" layanan backend—tersedia di <a href=\"https://github.com/samuelclay/NewsBlur\">GitHub</a>. Anda dapat "
"menghosting sendiri dengan Docker, berkontribusi fitur, atau mengaudit kodenya. Inoreader bersifat "
"eksklusif dan sumber tertutup. Jika Anda ingin beralih dari NewsBlur, ekspor OPML dapat membawa semua feed "
"Anda ke mana saja. Data bacaan Anda tidak akan pernah disandera."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur is fully open source under the MIT license. You can inspect the code, contribute features, or run "
"your own instance with Docker. Your data is truly yours. Feedly is a proprietary, closed-source service "
"with no self-hosted option. If Feedly shuts down or changes pricing, you have no alternative but to export "
"and leave."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur sepenuhnya bersumber terbuka di bawah lisensi MIT. Anda dapat memeriksa kode, berkontribusi dengan"
" fitur, atau menjalankan instans sendiri menggunakan Docker. Data Anda benar-benar milik Anda. Feedly "
"adalah layanan berpemilik dengan kode sumber tertutup dan tanpa opsi untuk dihosting sendiri. Jika Feedly "
"berhenti beroperasi atau mengubah harga, Anda tidak punya pilihan selain mengekspor data dan beralih."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur is fully open source under the MIT license. You can run your own instance, contribute features, or"
" audit the code. The entire application &mdash; web, iOS, Android, and all backend services &mdash; is on "
"GitHub. Inoreader is a closed-source proprietary service with no self-hosted option."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur sepenuhnya bersumber terbuka di bawah lisensi MIT. Anda dapat menjalankan instans sendiri, "
"berkontribusi fitur, atau mengaudit kodenya. Seluruh aplikasi &mdash; web, iOS, Android, dan semua layanan "
"backend &mdash; tersedia di GitHub. Inoreader adalah layanan proprieter bersumber tertutup tanpa opsi untuk"
" dihosting sendiri."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur is fully open source. Run your own instance with a single Docker command. Complete data ownership,"
" no lock-in. Customize it with Claude Code, contribute to development, or just run it on your own hardware."
" The entire codebase is on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur sepenuhnya bersifat sumber terbuka. Jalankan instans Anda sendiri dengan satu perintah Docker. "
"Kendali penuh atas data, tanpa keterikatan. Sesuaikan dengan Claude Code, berkontribusi pada pengembangan, "
"atau jalankan di perangkat keras Anda sendiri. Seluruh basis kodenya tersedia di GitHub."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur is released under the MIT license, the most permissive of the four readers compared here. The "
"entire codebase, including the web app, iOS app, Android app, and all backend services, is available on "
"GitHub. You can inspect how your data is handled, contribute features, or fork the project. Whether you use"
" the hosted service or run your own instance, you always have full visibility into the software."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur dirilis di bawah lisensi MIT, yang paling permisif di antara empat pembaca berita yang "
"dibandingkan di sini. Seluruh basis kode, termasuk aplikasi web, aplikasi iOS, aplikasi Android, dan semua "
"layanan backend, tersedia di GitHub. Anda dapat memeriksa cara data Anda ditangani, berkontribusi dengan "
"fitur, atau membuat fork proyek ini. Baik Anda menggunakan layanan yang dihosting maupun menjalankan "
"instans sendiri, Anda selalu dapat melihat perangkat lunaknya secara menyeluruh."

msgid "NewsBlur is the most feature-rich news reader. Here's everything it&nbsp;can&nbsp;do."
msgstr "NewsBlur adalah pembaca berita dengan fitur terlengkap. Berikut semua yang&nbsp;bisa&nbsp;dilakukannya."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur is the only self-hosted RSS reader that also offers a fully managed hosted service at "
"newsblur.com. This gives you a unique migration path that no other reader can match. You can start with the"
" hosted version, read your feeds without managing any infrastructure, and export your data via OPML "
"whenever you are ready to self-host. Or go the other direction: run your own instance first, and if you "
"decide you would rather not maintain a server, move to the hosted service and bring all your feeds and "
"training with you. FreshRSS, Miniflux, and Tiny Tiny RSS are self-host-only. If you want to stop running a "
"server, you have to switch to a completely different product."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur adalah satu-satunya pembaca RSS yang dapat dihosting sendiri sekaligus menawarkan layanan "
"terhosting terkelola penuh di newsblur.com. Ini memberi Anda jalur migrasi unik yang tak tertandingi "
"pembaca lain. Anda dapat memulai dengan versi terhosting, membaca feed tanpa mengelola infrastruktur apa "
"pun, dan mengekspor data melalui OPML kapan pun Anda siap menghosting sendiri. Atau lakukan sebaliknya: "
"jalankan instans Anda sendiri terlebih dahulu, lalu jika Anda memutuskan tidak ingin lagi mengelola server,"
" pindah ke layanan terhosting dan bawa semua feed serta pelatihan Anda. FreshRSS, Miniflux, dan Tiny Tiny "
"RSS hanya dapat dihosting sendiri. Jika Anda ingin berhenti menjalankan server, Anda harus beralih ke "
"produk yang sama sekali berbeda."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur launched in 2009 as an independent RSS reader. When Google Reader shut down in 2013, hundreds of "
"thousands of readers found their new home. Over a decade later, NewsBlur is still going strong."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur diluncurkan pada 2009 sebagai pembaca RSS independen. Saat Google Reader ditutup pada 2013, "
"ratusan ribu pembaca menemukan rumah baru mereka. Lebih dari satu dekade kemudian, NewsBlur masih terus "
"berkembang."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur launched to the public and to favorable reviews. Premium accounts launched in October, paying for "
"NewsBlur's increasing server costs."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur diluncurkan untuk publik dan mendapat ulasan positif. Akun Premium diluncurkan pada bulan Oktober "
"untuk menanggung biaya server NewsBlur yang terus meningkat."

msgid "NewsBlur monitors the page for changes automatically"
msgstr "NewsBlur memantau halaman secara otomatis untuk mendeteksi perubahan"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur offers a free plan with up to 64 sites and a 30-day premium trial for every new account. Feedbin "
"has no free tier and charges $50/year for a single plan. NewsBlur Premium at $36/year is more affordable "
"and includes up to 1,024 sites. The Archive plan at $99/year adds permanent story storage, Ask AI, daily "
"briefings, web feeds, and regex classifiers. Both readers let you export via OPML at any time."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur menawarkan paket gratis hingga 64 situs dan uji coba premium 30 hari untuk setiap akun baru. "
"Feedbin tidak memiliki paket gratis dan mengenakan biaya $50/tahun untuk satu paket. NewsBlur Premium "
"seharga $36/tahun lebih terjangkau dan mencakup hingga 1.024 situs. Paket Archive seharga $99/tahun "
"menambahkan penyimpanan artikel permanen, Tanya AI, ringkasan harian, feed web, dan pengklasifikasi regex. "
"Kedua layanan pembaca memungkinkan Anda mengekspor melalui OPML kapan saja."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur offers a free plan with up to 64 sites, and every new account gets a 30-day premium trial. "
"Readwise Reader requires a paid subscription ($96/year) with no free tier. NewsBlur is also fully open "
"source under the MIT license, so you can self-host your own instance, contribute to development, or audit "
"the code. Readwise Reader is a closed-source service."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur menawarkan paket gratis hingga 64 situs, dan setiap akun baru mendapatkan uji coba premium selama "
"30 hari. Readwise Reader memerlukan langganan berbayar ($96/tahun) tanpa paket gratis. NewsBlur juga "
"sepenuhnya bersumber terbuka di bawah lisensi MIT, sehingga Anda dapat meng-host sendiri, berkontribusi "
"pada pengembangan, atau mengaudit kodenya. Readwise Reader adalah layanan dengan kode sumber tertutup."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur offers intelligence training, full-text search, Ask AI, Web Feeds, native apps, and is fully open "
"source. No ads, no tracking, no algorithmic feeds."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur menawarkan pelatihan kecerdasan, pencarian teks lengkap, Tanya AI, Feed Web, aplikasi native, dan "
"sepenuhnya bersumber terbuka. Tanpa iklan, pelacakan, atau feed berbasis algoritme."

msgid "NewsBlur on iOS with native interface and full feature set"
msgstr "NewsBlur di iOS dengan antarmuka native dan fitur lengkap"

msgid "NewsBlur password"
msgstr "Kata sandi NewsBlur"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur stands out with AI features that Inoreader doesn't offer. Ask AI lets you query any story using "
"Claude, GPT, Gemini, or Grok &mdash; get summaries, extract key points, or ask follow-up questions. The "
"Daily Briefing generates a personalized AI summary of your top stories with customizable sections. These "
"features turn passive reading into active intelligence gathering."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur unggul dengan fitur AI yang tidak ditawarkan Inoreader. Tanya AI memungkinkan Anda bertanya "
"tentang artikel apa pun menggunakan Claude, GPT, Gemini, atau Grok &mdash; mendapatkan ringkasan, "
"mengekstrak poin penting, atau mengajukan pertanyaan lanjutan. Ringkasan Harian membuat ringkasan AI yang "
"dipersonalisasi dari artikel teratas Anda dengan bagian yang dapat disesuaikan. Fitur-fitur ini mengubah "
"membaca pasif menjadi pengumpulan informasi yang aktif."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur supports OAuth but to have an OAuth enabled client you must <a "
"href=\"mailto:samuel@newsblur.com\">email Samuel</a> to request a client ID and secret. You will need to "
"provide your NewsBlur username, redirect URI (often just your client app's website), and app name."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur mendukung OAuth, tetapi untuk menggunakan klien berkemampuan OAuth, Anda harus <a "
"href=\"mailto:samuel@newsblur.com\">mengirim email ke Samuel</a> untuk meminta ID dan rahasia klien. Anda "
"perlu memberikan nama pengguna NewsBlur, URI pengalihan (biasanya situs web aplikasi klien Anda), dan nama "
"aplikasi."

msgid "NewsBlur username"
msgstr "Nama pengguna NewsBlur"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur uses more server resources than the alternatives, and that is because it does more. Intelligence "
"training lets you highlight and hide stories by author, tag, title keyword, full text, URL, or regex "
"pattern. Ask AI lets you query any story with Claude, GPT, Gemini, or Grok. Native iOS and Android apps "
"connect to your self-hosted instance just as they do to the hosted service. You get email newsletter "
"ingestion, web feeds for sites without RSS, full-text Elasticsearch, story change tracking, social sharing "
"with blurblogs, and third-party app sync with Reeder, ReadKit, Unread, and more. If you want a minimal, "
"lightweight reader, Miniflux or FreshRSS are great choices. If you want the most capable self-hosted RSS "
"reader available, NewsBlur is it."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur menggunakan lebih banyak sumber daya server daripada alternatif lain karena fiturnya lebih banyak."
" Pelatihan kecerdasan memungkinkan Anda menyorot dan menyembunyikan artikel berdasarkan penulis, tag, kata "
"kunci judul, teks lengkap, URL, atau pola regex. Tanya AI memungkinkan Anda mengajukan pertanyaan tentang "
"artikel apa pun menggunakan Claude, GPT, Gemini, atau Grok. Aplikasi iOS dan Android native terhubung ke "
"instans yang Anda hosting sendiri seperti halnya ke layanan yang dihosting. Anda juga mendapatkan fitur "
"pengumpulan buletin email, feed web untuk situs tanpa RSS, Elasticsearch teks lengkap, pelacakan perubahan "
"artikel, berbagi sosial melalui blurblog, dan sinkronisasi aplikasi pihak ketiga dengan Reeder, ReadKit, "
"Unread, dan lainnya. Jika Anda menginginkan pembaca yang minimal dan ringan, Miniflux atau FreshRSS adalah "
"pilihan yang bagus. Jika Anda menginginkan pembaca RSS self-hosted paling mumpuni, pilih NewsBlur."

msgid "NewsBlur vs Feedbin"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs Feedbin"

msgid "NewsBlur vs Feedbin - RSS Reader Comparison"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs Feedbin - Perbandingan Pembaca RSS"

msgid "NewsBlur vs Feedly"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs Feedly"

msgid "NewsBlur vs Feedly - RSS Reader Comparison"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs Feedly - Perbandingan Pembaca RSS"

msgid "NewsBlur vs Inoreader"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs Inoreader"

msgid "NewsBlur vs Inoreader - RSS Reader Comparison"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs Inoreader - Perbandingan Pembaca RSS"

msgid "NewsBlur vs Readwise Reader"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs Readwise Reader"

msgid "NewsBlur vs Readwise Reader - RSS Reader Comparison"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs Readwise Reader - Perbandingan Pembaca RSS"

msgid "NewsBlur vs The Old Reader"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs The Old Reader"

msgid "NewsBlur vs The Old Reader - RSS Reader Comparison"
msgstr "NewsBlur vs The Old Reader - Perbandingan Pembaca RSS"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur was founded in 2009 as an independent, one-person project with a simple goal: build a better RSS "
"reader. At the time, Google Reader dominated the market. But NewsBlur offered something Google never did. "
"It let you train your feeds with intelligence classifiers so you could focus on the stories that matter and"
" hide the ones that don't."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur didirikan pada 2009 sebagai proyek independen yang dikerjakan satu orang dengan tujuan sederhana: "
"membuat pembaca RSS yang lebih baik. Saat itu, Google Reader mendominasi pasar. Namun, NewsBlur menawarkan "
"sesuatu yang tidak pernah dimiliki Google. Anda dapat melatih feed menggunakan pengklasifikasi cerdas agar "
"bisa berfokus pada berita yang penting dan menyembunyikan yang tidak penting."

msgid "NewsBlur website: <a href=\"https://www.newsblur.com\">www.newsblur.com</a>"
msgstr "Situs web NewsBlur: <a href=\"https://www.newsblur.com\">www.newsblur.com</a>"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur works with popular third-party apps like Reeder, ReadKit, and Unread through its open API. You can"
" read on the web, on the native iOS and Android apps, or through the client of your choice. There's also a "
"free plan with up to 64 sites, so you can try it without commitment."
msgstr ""
"NewsBlur mendukung aplikasi pihak ketiga populer seperti Reeder, ReadKit, dan Unread melalui API "
"terbukanya. Anda dapat membaca di web, melalui aplikasi iOS dan Android asli, atau dengan klien pilihan "
"Anda. Tersedia juga paket gratis hingga 64 situs, sehingga Anda dapat mencobanya tanpa komitmen."

msgid "NewsBlur — Personal News Reader with Intelligence Training"
msgstr "NewsBlur — Pembaca Berita Personal dengan Pelatihan Kecerdasan"

msgid ""
"NewsBlur's API allows users to retrieve their feeds, feed counts, feed icons, feed statistics, and "
"individual feed stories. No API key is required, but you are required to authenticate before using any of "
"the API endpoints. Please be considerate, and don't hammer our servers."
msgstr ""
"API NewsBlur memungkinkan pengguna mengambil feed, jumlah item feed, ikon feed, statistik feed, dan artikel"
" dari masing-masing feed. Kunci API tidak diperlukan, tetapi Anda harus melakukan autentikasi sebelum "
"menggunakan endpoint API mana pun. Mohon gunakan dengan bijak dan jangan membebani server kami."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur's Ask AI feature lets you query any story using Claude, GPT, Gemini, or Grok. Summarize articles, "
"ask follow-up questions, extract key points, or get context on topics you're unfamiliar with. Daily AI "
"briefings give you an overview of what matters across all your feeds. These features are included in the "
"Archive plan at $99/year, which is less than Inoreader's Pro plan at $99.99/year."
msgstr ""
"Fitur Tanya AI NewsBlur memungkinkan Anda mengajukan pertanyaan tentang artikel apa pun menggunakan Claude,"
" GPT, Gemini, atau Grok. Ringkas artikel, ajukan pertanyaan lanjutan, ambil poin-poin penting, atau cari "
"konteks tentang topik yang belum Anda kenal. Ringkasan AI harian memberi gambaran tentang hal-hal penting "
"di seluruh feed Anda. Fitur ini termasuk dalam paket Archive seharga $99/tahun, lebih murah daripada paket "
"Pro Inoreader seharga $99.99/tahun."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur's intelligence training lets you highlight or hide stories based on author, tag, title keywords, "
"full text content, URLs, and regex patterns. Over time, your feeds become personalized. Stories are color-"
"coded green (focus), yellow (neutral), and red (hidden). Feedbin has no equivalent filtering system. You "
"manage reading through folders, tags, and manual triage. For high-volume reading across hundreds of feeds, "
"NewsBlur's training is a major advantage."
msgstr ""
"Pelatihan kecerdasan NewsBlur memungkinkan Anda menyorot atau menyembunyikan artikel berdasarkan penulis, "
"tag, kata kunci judul, isi lengkap, URL, dan pola regex. Seiring waktu, feed Anda menjadi lebih personal. "
"Artikel diberi kode warna: hijau (fokus), kuning (netral), dan merah (disembunyikan). Feedbin tidak "
"memiliki sistem penyaringan serupa. Anda mengelola bacaan melalui folder, tag, dan pemilahan manual. Untuk "
"membaca konten dalam jumlah besar dari ratusan feed, fitur pelatihan NewsBlur merupakan keunggulan utama."

msgid ""
"NewsBlur's intelligence training system lets you highlight or hide stories based on author, tag, title "
"keywords, full text content, URLs, and regex patterns. Over time, your feeds become personalized without "
"any algorithmic black box. Readwise Reader has no equivalent system. You manage your reading through manual"
" triage, filters, and folder organization. For high-volume reading across hundreds of feeds, NewsBlur's "
"training is a significant advantage."
msgstr ""
"Sistem pelatihan kecerdasan NewsBlur memungkinkan Anda menyorot atau menyembunyikan artikel berdasarkan "
"penulis, tag, kata kunci judul, isi lengkap, URL, dan pola regex. Seiring waktu, feed Anda menjadi personal"
" tanpa kotak hitam algoritmik. Readwise Reader tidak memiliki sistem yang setara. Anda mengelola bacaan "
"melalui seleksi manual, filter, dan pengaturan folder. Untuk membaca banyak konten dari ratusan feed, "
"pelatihan NewsBlur merupakan keunggulan yang signifikan."

