msgid ""
"When Google announced the shutdown of Google Reader in March 2013, millions of people scrambled for an "
"alternative. NewsBlur was one of the top destinations for that migration. The servers were overwhelmed for "
"weeks as new users flooded in. That moment proved something important: people care deeply about RSS, and "
"they need a reader they can count on."
msgstr ""
"Ketika Google mengumumkan penutupan Google Reader pada Maret 2013, jutaan orang bergegas mencari "
"alternatif. NewsBlur menjadi salah satu tujuan utama migrasi itu. Server kewalahan selama berminggu-minggu "
"saat pengguna baru berdatangan. Momen itu membuktikan sesuatu yang penting: orang sangat peduli dengan RSS,"
" dan mereka membutuhkan pembaca yang dapat diandalkan."

msgid "When a feed updates, NewsBlur checks for duplicate stories across all your subscriptions"
msgstr "Saat feed diperbarui, NewsBlur memeriksa artikel duplikat di semua langganan Anda"

msgid ""
"When feeds only include summaries, Text view fetches the full article from the source. Clean formatting, no"
" clutter."
msgstr ""
"Jika feed hanya memuat ringkasan, tampilan Teks mengambil artikel lengkap dari sumbernya. Pemformatan rapi,"
" tanpa hal yang mengganggu."

msgid "When multiple feeds cover the same story, NewsBlur groups them together so you only see it once."
msgstr "Jika beberapa feed memuat berita yang sama, NewsBlur mengelompokkannya agar Anda hanya melihatnya sekali."

msgid ""
"When multiple feeds cover the same story, NewsBlur groups them together so you only see it once. Semantic "
"duplicate detection uses fuzzy title matching to catch stories that are similar but not identical. Read the"
" version you prefer and skip the rest."
msgstr ""
"Saat beberapa feed memuat berita yang sama, NewsBlur mengelompokkannya agar Anda hanya melihatnya sekali. "
"Deteksi duplikat semantik menggunakan pencocokan judul yang fleksibel untuk menemukan berita yang serupa, "
"tetapi tidak persis sama. Baca versi yang Anda sukai dan lewati sisanya."

msgid ""
"When multiple feeds cover the same story, they're grouped together. Read your preferred version and skip "
"duplicates."
msgstr ""
"Jika beberapa feed memuat artikel yang sama, artikel-artikel itu akan dikelompokkan. Baca versi pilihan "
"Anda dan lewati duplikatnya."

msgid ""
"When you subscribe to a feed, NewsBlur back-fills its entire available history. Going forward, every story "
"is kept forever."
msgstr ""
"Saat Anda berlangganan feed, NewsBlur akan mengimpor seluruh riwayat yang tersedia. Selanjutnya, setiap "
"artikel akan disimpan selamanya."

msgid "When you subscribe to a new feed, its history is back-filled"
msgstr "Saat Anda berlangganan feed baru, riwayat feed tersebut akan diisi mundur"

msgid ""
"Whether you're coming from Google Reader's old OPML export, another RSS reader, or starting fresh, NewsBlur"
" makes it simple to get set up. Import your OPML file and all your feeds and folders appear instantly. "
"NewsBlur also supports exporting your subscriptions at any time, so you're never locked in."
msgstr ""
"Baik Anda beralih dari ekspor OPML lama Google Reader, pembaca RSS lain, atau memulai dari awal, NewsBlur "
"memudahkan Anda untuk mulai menggunakannya. Impor file OPML Anda dan semua feed serta folder akan langsung "
"muncul. NewsBlur juga mendukung ekspor langganan kapan saja, jadi Anda tidak akan terkunci."

