msgid ""
"Yes! Basic intelligence training on authors, tags, and title keywords is free. Full-text training on story "
"content requires Premium Archive."
msgstr ""
"Ya! Pelatihan kecerdasan dasar tentang penulis, tag, dan kata kunci judul gratis. Pelatihan teks lengkap "
"untuk isi artikel memerlukan Premium Archive."

msgid "Yes, Ask AI works on any story in your feeds, including archived stories."
msgstr "Ya, Tanya AI dapat digunakan pada artikel apa pun di feed Anda, termasuk artikel yang diarsipkan."

msgid "Yes, Premium Archive includes all Premium features plus the archive, AI, and advanced training features."
msgstr "Ya, Premium Archive mencakup semua fitur Premium ditambah arsip, AI, dan fitur pelatihan tingkat lanjut."

