msgid ""
"Yes. Every tag generates its own RSS feed, so you can subscribe to it from another reader, share the link, "
"or pipe it into IFTTT or Zapier."
msgstr ""
"Ya. Setiap tag menghasilkan feed RSS sendiri, sehingga Anda dapat berlangganan dari pembaca lain, "
"membagikan tautannya, atau menghubungkannya ke IFTTT atau Zapier."

msgid ""
"Yes. Full sync with Reeder, ReadKit, Unread, NetNewsWire, and many more. Your read state, saved stories, "
"and training sync across every app."
msgstr ""
"Ya. Sinkronisasi penuh dengan Reeder, ReadKit, Unread, NetNewsWire, dan banyak lagi. Status baca, artikel "
"tersimpan, dan pelatihan Anda disinkronkan di semua aplikasi."

msgid ""
"Yes. NewsBlur is fully open source and can be self-hosted with a single Docker command. Visit the <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/samuelclay/NewsBlur\" class=\"NB-splash-link\">GitHub repository</a> for "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"Ya. NewsBlur sepenuhnya bersumber terbuka dan dapat dihosting sendiri dengan satu perintah Docker. Kunjungi"
" <a href=\"https://github.com/samuelclay/NewsBlur\" class=\"NB-splash-link\">repositori GitHub</a> untuk "
"petunjuk."

msgid ""
"Yes. NewsBlur supports OPML import, so you can bring your feeds from Google Reader, Feedly, Inoreader, or "
"any other RSS reader."
msgstr ""
"Ya. NewsBlur mendukung impor OPML, jadi Anda dapat membawa feed dari Google Reader, Feedly, Inoreader, atau"
" pembaca RSS lainnya."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Yes. Pass <code>%(server_flag)s</code> to any command, or set the <code>%(variable)s</code> environment "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"Ya. Berikan <code>%(server_flag)s</code> ke perintah apa pun, atau atur variabel lingkungan "
"<code>%(variable)s</code>."

msgid ""
"Yes. Stories are cached locally and the iOS app uses background refresh to stay up to date even when you're"
" not using it."
msgstr ""
"Ya. Artikel disimpan dalam cache lokal dan aplikasi iOS menggunakan penyegaran latar belakang agar tetap "
"mutakhir meskipun tidak sedang Anda gunakan."

msgid ""
"Yes. Upload your OPML file and NewsBlur imports all your subscriptions and folders in seconds. Works with "
"Google Reader exports, Feedly, Inoreader, and more."
msgstr ""
"Ya. Unggah file OPML Anda dan NewsBlur akan mengimpor semua langganan dan folder Anda dalam hitungan detik."
" Berfungsi dengan ekspor Google Reader, Feedly, Inoreader, dan lainnya."

msgid ""
"Yes. Web Feeds monitor a page's HTML for changes, while RSS reads a structured feed file. Web Feeds work "
"even when sites don't offer RSS."
msgstr ""
"Ya. Feed Web memantau HTML halaman untuk melihat perubahan, sedangkan RSS membaca berkas feed terstruktur. "
"Feed Web tetap berfungsi meskipun situs tidak menyediakan RSS."

#, python-format
msgid "Yesterday, %(date)s %(time)s"
msgstr "Kemarin, %(date)s %(time)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Yesterday, %(time)s"
msgstr "Kemarin, %(time)s"

msgid ""
"You are at the front of the line! Just a few more minutes<br />until you receive your free invite to use "
"NewsBlur."
msgstr ""
"Anda berada di urutan terdepan! Tunggu beberapa menit lagi<br />hingga Anda menerima undangan gratis untuk "
"menggunakan NewsBlur."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are not required to use OAuth, in which case you will need to pass the <code>%(cookie_name)s</code> "
"cookie with every request. This cookie is set on <a href=\"#/api/login\">login</a>."
msgstr ""
"Anda tidak wajib menggunakan OAuth. Jika tidak, Anda perlu mengirim cookie <code>%(cookie_name)s</code> "
"pada setiap permintaan. Cookie ini diatur saat <a href=\"#/api/login\">login</a>."

msgid "You are not subscribed to this feed"
msgstr "Anda tidak berlangganan feed ini"

msgid "You can train per-feed, per-folder (Archive), or globally (Archive). Per-feed training is free."
msgstr "Anda dapat melatih per feed, per folder (Archive), atau secara global (Archive). Pelatihan per feed gratis."

msgid "You cannot favorite your own shared story comment."
msgstr "Anda tidak dapat memfavoritkan komentar artikel yang Anda bagikan sendiri."

msgid "You cannot share newsletters. Somebody could unsubscribe you!"
msgstr "Anda tidak dapat membagikan buletin. Orang lain bisa berhenti berlangganan atas nama Anda!"

msgid "You decide what to focus and hide"
msgstr "Anda menentukan apa yang ingin ditampilkan dan disembunyikan"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You favorited <span class=\"NB-interaction-username NB-splash-link\" data-user-"
"id=\"%(user_id)s\">%(other_username)s</span>'s comments on <span class=\"NB-interaction-sharedstory-title "
"NB-splash-link\">%(title)s</span>:"
msgstr ""
"Anda menyukai komentar <span class=\"NB-interaction-username NB-splash-link\" data-user-"
"id=\"%(user_id)s\">%(other_username)s</span> di <span class=\"NB-interaction-sharedstory-title NB-splash-"
"link\">%(title)s</span>:"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You followed <span class=\"NB-interaction-username NB-splash-link\" data-user-"
"id=\"%(user_id)s\">%(other_username)s</span>."
msgstr ""
"Anda mengikuti <span class=\"NB-interaction-username NB-splash-link\" data-user-"
"id=\"%(user_id)s\">%(other_username)s</span>."

msgid "You have a lot of subscriptions! We're preparing your OPML export file now."
msgstr "Anda memiliki banyak langganan! Kami sedang menyiapkan file ekspor OPML Anda."

msgid ""
"You may use the API commercially, by which we mean you may charge people money to use your project which "
"itself uses the API. You may not, however, sell advertising against any data retrieved from NewsBlur's API."
" Essentially, you can charge money for your application or service, but not wrap NewsBlur in "
"advertisements."
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menggunakan API untuk tujuan komersial. Artinya, Anda boleh mengenakan biaya kepada orang lain "
"untuk menggunakan proyek Anda yang memanfaatkan API ini. Namun, Anda tidak boleh memasang iklan berdasarkan"
" data apa pun yang diperoleh dari API NewsBlur. Singkatnya, Anda boleh mengenakan biaya untuk aplikasi atau"
" layanan Anda, tetapi jangan menyisipkan iklan di NewsBlur."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You replied to <span class=\"NB-interaction-username NB-splash-link\" data-user-"
"id=\"%(user_id)s\">%(other_username)s</span>:"
msgstr ""
"Anda membalas <span class=\"NB-interaction-username NB-splash-link\" data-user-"
"id=\"%(user_id)s\">%(other_username)s</span>:"

