msgstr "Anda mendaftar ke NewsBlur."

#, python-format
msgid "You subscribed to <span class=\"NB-interaction-feed-title NB-splash-link\">%(feed_title)s</span>."
msgstr "Anda berlangganan <span class=\"NB-interaction-feed-title NB-splash-link\">%(feed_title)s</span>."

msgid "You train the reader, not the other way around"
msgstr "Anda yang melatih pembaca, bukan sebaliknya"

msgid "You will no longer receive any emails from NewsBlur."
msgstr "Anda tidak akan lagi menerima email dari NewsBlur."

msgid "You will no longer receive email notifications for this story."
msgstr "Anda tidak akan lagi menerima notifikasi email untuk artikel ini."

#, python-format
msgid "You will not be charged until %(date)s"
msgstr "Anda tidak akan dikenai biaya hingga %(date)s"

msgid "You will receive an email shortly with your subscription backup attached."
msgstr "Anda akan segera menerima email dengan cadangan langganan terlampir."

msgid "You're in control, not an algorithm"
msgstr "Anda yang mengendalikan, bukan algoritma"

msgid "You've been gifted a premium subscription! Sign up to claim it."
msgstr "Anda mendapat hadiah langganan premium! Daftar untuk mengklaimnya."

msgid "YouTube search request failed."
msgstr "Permintaan penelusuran YouTube gagal."

msgid "Your Gift is Ready!"
msgstr "Hadiah Anda Siap!"

msgid "Your OPML export is being processed"
msgstr "Ekspor OPML Anda sedang diproses"

msgid "Your OPML export is being processed. You will receive an email shortly with your subscription backup."
msgstr "Ekspor OPML Anda sedang diproses. Anda akan segera menerima email berisi cadangan langganan Anda."

msgid "Your account"
msgstr "Akun Anda"

msgid ""
"Your account reverts to the free tier. You keep all your feeds (up to 64), training, and saved stories. No "
"data is deleted. Upgrade again anytime and everything is restored."
msgstr ""
"Akun Anda akan kembali ke paket gratis. Semua feed (hingga 64), pelatihan, dan artikel tersimpan tetap Anda"
" miliki. Tidak ada data yang dihapus. Anda bisa meningkatkan paket lagi kapan saja dan semuanya akan "
"dipulihkan."

msgid "Your applications"
msgstr "Aplikasi Anda"

msgid "Your archived stories remain accessible, but new stories follow the standard retention policy."
msgstr "Artikel yang telah diarsipkan tetap dapat diakses, tetapi artikel baru mengikuti kebijakan retensi standar."

msgid "Your archived stories remain accessible, but new stories will start following the standard retention policy."
msgstr ""
"Artikel yang diarsipkan tetap dapat diakses, tetapi artikel baru akan mengikuti kebijakan penyimpanan "
"standar."

msgid ""
"Your complete news archive with AI-powered intelligence. 4,096 sites, full story archive, Ask AI, and daily"
" briefing."
msgstr ""
"Arsip berita lengkap Anda dengan kecerdasan berbasis AI. 4.096 situs, arsip artikel lengkap, Tanya AI, dan "
"ringkasan harian."

msgid "Your email address"
msgstr "Alamat email Anda"

msgid ""
"Your feeds and saved stories are never deleted. If you downgrade from Archive, older stories will no longer"
" appear in search results but will be available again if you re-upgrade. If you exceed the feed limit of a "
"lower tier, you'll be asked to mute some feeds."
msgstr ""
"Feed dan artikel tersimpan Anda tidak akan pernah dihapus. Jika Anda menurunkan paket dari Archive, artikel"
" yang lebih lama tidak akan muncul lagi di hasil pencarian, tetapi akan tersedia kembali jika Anda "
"meningkatkan paket. Jika jumlah feed Anda melebihi batas paket yang lebih rendah, Anda akan diminta untuk "
"membisukan beberapa feed."

msgid "Your gift code is invalid. Check it for errors."
msgstr "Kode hadiah Anda tidak valid. Periksa apakah ada kesalahan."

msgid "Your gift code should be 12 characters long."
msgstr "Kode hadiah Anda harus terdiri dari 12 karakter."

msgid "Your inbox stays clean"
msgstr "Kotak masuk Anda tetap rapi"

msgid "Your new password"
msgstr "Kata sandi baru Anda"

msgid "Your old password is incorrect."
msgstr "Kata sandi lama Anda salah."

msgid "Your password doesn't match."
msgstr "Kata sandi Anda tidak cocok."

msgid "Your payment is being processed. Your gift link will be available shortly."
msgstr "Pembayaran Anda sedang diproses. Tautan hadiah Anda akan segera tersedia."

